ntent":"现在开始介绍一下搭建过程"},"52":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-6","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#pingora-是什么","content":"pingora 是 cloudflare 公司开源的一个代理框架，本意是为了弥补一些 nginx 的不足。\n我研究 pingora 的原因纯粹是想学习一下 rust，要说 pingora 能不能很好的替代 nginx，\n还得看大家的需求。"},"53":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-7","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#快速上手-pingora","content":"pingora源码官方地址\npingora快速上手文档"},"54":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-8","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#快速上手-pingora","content":"从 pingora 的快速文档可以看出来 pingora 其实只是开源了一个可变成的 http 服务框架，\n有兴趣的朋友可以按照教程跑一下。我自己因为跑不通他们的 1.1.1.1 的服务器，所以没成功。\n但是他是自带了一个代理服务器需要的组件。所有的代码我还没有研究过，本文仅解释一下被用来\n实现反向代理的组件"},"55":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-9","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#热豆腐","content":"心急的朋友可以直接看下面是我搞得一个项目 demo\n项目源码位置\n可以根据 README 里的说明来实现一个反向代理"},"56":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-10","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"要实现反向代理，首先需要添加 pingora 的依赖，修改 cargo.toml\n添加"},"57":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-11","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"pingora 的两个组件用来实现反向代理"},"58":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-12","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"Server\nServer是在 server mod 下。主要用来启动一个 http 服务。关键代码如下"},"59":{"id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy-13","page_id":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pingora_proxy#现在开始介绍一下搭建过程","content":"ProxyHttp\nProxyHttp是在 proxy_trait mod下\nProxyHttp封装了关键的代理需要的方法，要实现反向代理，我们需要创建一个 struct，并实现 ProxyHttp trait\n在 MyProxy 中实现一个方法 upstream_peer，例子如下"},"60":{"id":"/docs